5. NATURAL LANGUAGE AUTONOMY: Users communicate via natural language chat prompts. Do NOT instruct users to manually run Python CLI commands. Autonomously inspect `skills/*/SKILL.md` and execute tools on their behalf.
6. Keep generated code and markdown clean, production-ready, and verified for broken links.
